po"><addressbook><name>SEKIGUCHI RYOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIBATA ITSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKI HITOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>EDAGAWA, SHINICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>JU-OH INC.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MUNAKATA, TAMOTSU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEKIGUCHI, RYOICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIBATA, ITSUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKI, HITOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>EDAGAWA SHINICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MUNAKATA TAMOTSU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEKIGUCHI RYOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIBATA ITSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKI HITOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>EDAGAWA, SHINICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MUNAKATA, TAMOTSU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEKIGUCHI, RYOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIBATA, ITSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKI, HITOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An induction heating method for a manifold of a hot runner metal mold having a fixed metal mold and a movable metal mold capable of uniformly heating a material over the entire length of a runner and also capable of easily attaching and detaching a coil from the manifold, comprising the steps of providing a space along a side face (10b) onto which a mold clamping pressure by the fixed metal mold and the movable metal mold does not act, winding the coil (17), in the space, on the side face (10b) along the axis of the runner of the manifold (10), and induction-heating the manifold (10) from the side face (10b).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un procédé de chauffage par induction de la rampe de carottes chauffantes de moules à métal comportant une partie fixe et une partie mobile. Ledit procédé, qui produit un chauffage uniforme sur la totalité de la longueur des carottes et permet de monter facilement la bobine sur les carottes et de la démonter, consiste à laisser un espace libre le long d'une face latérale (10b) sur laquelle n'agit pas la pression de fermeture plaquant la partie fixe sur la partie mobile, puis à bobiner la bobine sur ledit espace de ladite face latérale ((10b) et le long de la carotte de la rampe (10), puis à chauffer par induction la rampe) par sa face latérale (10b).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>